  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "UpSparkle 1.1.1.0 - 2026-11-13\n\nAdded\n\n- Automatic update settings: IsAutomaticCheckForUpdates, UpdateCheckInterval, and\n  LastCheckTime on UpSparkleUpdater.\n- CheckUpdateWithoutUI(): triggers a background update check without the progress UI.\n- SetHttpHeader / ClearHttpHeaders: attach custom HTTP headers to appcast checks,\n  release-note downloads, and update downloads.\n- Error event, raised when the native updater reports a failure. The normal\n  \"no update found\" outcome and user-cancelled installations are not reported.\n- Eto Forms demo covering the Gtk, macOS, and WPF backends.\n- Daily GitHub Actions workflow that checks Sparkle, libMacSparkle, and WinSparkle\n  releases and opens a pull request when a newer version is available.\n- NuGet package icon.\n\nChanged\n\n- Updated native dependencies: Sparkle 2.10.1, libMacSparkle 1.2.0, WinSparkle 0.9.4.\n- Moved the demo projects from src/Demos/ to the top-level examples/ directory.\n- Expanded the demo applications with automatic-check, interval, last-check,\n  HTTP-header, and background-check controls.\n- Expanded the test suite from 30 to 36 tests.\n- Updated the README API reference to document the complete public surface.\n\nFixed\n\n- The Error event no longer fires for \"no update found\" or user-cancelled\n  installations.\n- Native callbacks are safe under Mono AOT / IL2CPP via MonoPInvokeCallback.",
